{"comment": "alice challenges bob and carol to uno; both accept. The dealer, every hand and the card turned up come from the game's random seed, so they and who acts first are placeholders; a reused placeholder must take the same value, so each hand stays exactly what its owner alone saw. bob resigns and play goes on for two; then carol resigns and alice wins."}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "alice", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "alice", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "bob", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "bob", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "bob", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "bob", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "carol", "send": {"id": 1, "type": "auth.login", "body": {"v": 1, "username": "carol", "password": "correct horse"}}}
{"client": "carol", "recv": {"id": 1, "type": "ok", "body": {"user": "carol", "heartbeat_ms": 15000}}}
{"client": "alice", "send": {"id": 2, "type": "challenge.create", "body": {"to": ["bob", "carol"], "game": "uno", "options": {}}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"id": 2, "type": "ok", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge"}}}
{"client": "alice", "recv": {"type": "challenge.changed", "body": {"challenge_id": "$challenge", "from": "alice", "to": ["bob", "carol"], "accepted": [], "game": "uno", "options": {}, "state": "pending", "by": null, "game_id": null, "expires_at": "$expires_at"}}}
