{"comment": "Each player sees its own seven cards and the other hands as counts. The deal's events name the dealer and the card turned up, and its effect on the first player: a skip, a reverse, a draw two or a wild to name the colour of. Only the seat to act is offered its action kinds and the cards it may play; the others get []."}
